{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6bad2e04544b46195ba9ac678acb1f5b20c330b2be3c2ab2ab0926ee57d4273c", "ja": "のり子。この前、モンスターを退治する\n戦士役の撮影をしたけど、あの仕事はどうだった？", "zh": "法子，之前你拍了饰演战士打倒怪兽的影片，\n你觉得那份工作怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "92ed138dbc533bc9c8d49562ed5c192b07c4be1a4e1d11ad92f00de960690cc9", "ja": "あー、あれ？　すっごく楽しかったよ！　必殺技の\n名前を大声で叫んだりしてさ、気持ちよかったな～♪", "zh": "啊～那个喔？很好玩啊！\n我还有大声喊出必杀技的名称，超痛快的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1002_p", "source_sha256": "deaced6fd50d988cd1b4ca69bac9025e332f2a9cbd836ac9e2c8abed751944c7", "ja": "そうか。続編があるって聞いたから、\nまた次もやれるといいな。", "zh": "这样啊。我听说会有续集，\n真希望下次你也能参与演出呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "b2b60da62219c1574da307af65650ead05b9be526d1f8bb055814f6c3d149d4d", "ja": "うん、やりたいやりたい！\nあ、でも……。", "zh": "嗯，我想演我想演！\n啊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "1ef267974330e7759160d6cba3a46be9d5155d0553b25a1cf37b13c6942c536c", "ja": "できれば、この前の水浴びシーンみたいなのは\nないほうがいいかな～なんて……あははっ。", "zh": "可以的话，如果不用再拍之前那种洗澡的桥段，\n那就更好了……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ac8de2dde9d35a71b597469114dd4e80159391e2df8a8afccf6a5a4cdc87de43", "ja": "どうしてだ？　あのシーン、評判良かったのに。", "zh": "为什么？那一段评价很好耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "da3066360122578a3e7f88f38d3fec71ab1e9b96b1f204bb0e23dd8735b3382f", "ja": "えっ、そうなの！？　剣を振り回して、\n必殺技出してるアタシがカッコイイとかじゃなくて！？", "zh": "咦，是吗！？\n不是称赞我挥剑、使出必杀技很帅之类的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9bef123dc741d7db0551b7faebb8e4cec64500c142dbbda296f9a4cd02aabffe", "ja": "そっちももちろん評判だけど、\n沐浴シーンもよかったって。", "zh": "那方面的评价当然也很好，\n但沐浴桥段也被称赞很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0712c48d769d0dcab51da97e6735e9509e961350fbc0e849ed570bd5272fc86a", "ja": "カッコイイだけじゃなく、可愛いところも\nのり子の魅力だからな。", "zh": "因为不仅只有帅气，\n可爱之处也是法子的魅力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "d865d6a0dc809f720cd7537f4c14b49dfec51096549ba77911cd509c1fad3e4b", "ja": "うう……そう言われると、なんか照れるけど……\nま、でもみんなが喜んでくれたならいっか！", "zh": "呜呜……被你这么一说，总觉得有点难为情……\n也罢，既然大家看得开心那就算了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "847c9b6bf9efdf7b8cebdc0d4cdba31ede0e0aa339126ba998f2ae510b6d0e32", "ja": "{$P$}。アタシ、\n続編があるなら出たい。スタッフさんに伝えておいて！", "zh": "{$P$}，你去跟工作人员说，\n要是有续集的话，我想参加演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "c6dd93d99d5d9f7cf9fcac547aeb1dd1503d226aeb971125cd6a08a6d6d0b592", "ja": "次に出る時は、もっともっと必殺技の腕をみがいて、\n最強無敵の戦士！って感じに役作りしておくから！", "zh": "下次演出时，我会加倍磨练必杀技的技术，\n塑造出「无人能敌的战士！」这样的角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bfe9437a127cbc7cdf0fc4f0b3be92bec2ee233caabe6f1452067b1ccb798433", "ja": "最強無敵の戦士もいいけど、最強無敵のアイドルもな！\nのり子にピッタリだと思うぞ。", "zh": "无人能敌的战士是不错，也别忘了无人能敌的偶像喔！\n我觉得这样很有法子的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "0251e4438a742ff4d36d42e9f389337f704929952be076b60c2e697f0635a951", "ja": "うん！　それじゃ、最強無敵のアイドルを目指して\n今日もお仕事がんばろうかな。", "zh": "嗯！那么我就以无人能敌的偶像为目标，\n今天继续努力工作吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "2a7d421fbe9d96a1929035fe216354ca368458e0d5fc0b3feec09c75692133c8", "ja": "{$P$}とアタシのタッグで、\nアイドル界のチャンピオンベルトを掴み取らないとね♪", "zh": "要靠{$P$}加上我的拍挡组合，\n夺下偶像界的冠军腰带♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b81c4b8dace0cd5880ecdb3d5d6e08d34424dee7e58a4747c60c41def919b55f", "ja": "のり子の気合に負けないように、\n俺もたくさん仕事をとってこないとな。", "zh": "为了不输给法子的气魄，\n我也要争取到很多工作才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0063_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "9f6fdd5abce376099e5236fbc475e3d53565f0dec7d34f48f1f1486f2b04b827", "ja": "うん、お願い！　……あっ、でもやっぱり\nあんまり恥ずかしいのはナシで……うう……。", "zh": "嗯，拜托你了！……啊，不过那种太难为情的工作，\n还是免了吧……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
